; Static code/data review: code means decoded instructions with a control-flow basis.
; bytedata means byte emission; data and unresolved/padding are separated in rom-data-evidence.tsv and static-rom-review.md.
; End addresses are exclusive. This full 0000-2000 partition is checked by scripts/roundtrip_rom.py.
